<title>USA: Apple South names Kirk Kinsell president.</title>
<headline>Apple South names Kirk Kinsell president.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple South Inc on Thursday said that S. Kirk Kinsell would join the company as president and chief operating officer, effective February 17.</p>
<p>Kinsell, currently president of the franchise division of ITT Corp's Sheraton Corp and its Four Points Hotels, will assume responsibility for Apple South's 309 casual dining restaurants.</p>
